From: Diogo Trindade <diogotr7@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: wcd939x: program PCM crosstalk coefficients with the
 compander bypassed

HPH PCM PA startup enables the crosstalk path for both channels, but the
PCM DAC startup returns before writing the crosstalk coefficients when the
compander is disabled. Starting directly in bypass mode therefore runs
the crosstalk path with its reset coefficients. A stream that enabled the
compander earlier leaves the coefficients behind, which hides the missing
initialization until the next cold boot.

Write the coefficients before the bypass return, so PCM startup no longer
depends on an earlier compander-enabled stream. Compander thresholds,
clocking and reset stay conditional.

This fixes the downstream HPH PCM mode (0073) and has no mainline
counterpart.
---
 sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
index 0022c70..e8f4b6b 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
@@ -535,6 +535,11 @@ static void wcd939x_hph_pcm_pre_dac(struct snd_soc_component *component,
 					      WCD939X_REFBUFF_UHQA_CTL_REFBUFN_IOUT_CTL, 1);
 	}
 
+	/* The PCM crosstalk path is enabled even with the compander bypassed. */
+	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 0, 0x1f);
+	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 3, 0x4f);
+	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 2, 0x11);
+
 	if (!comp_en) {
 		/* compander bypassed, gain from register */
 		if (hphr)
@@ -583,11 +588,6 @@ static void wcd939x_hph_pcm_pre_dac(struct snd_soc_component *component,
 	else
 		snd_soc_component_write_field(component, WCD939X_DIGITAL_CDC_COMP_CTL_0,
 					      WCD939X_CDC_COMP_CTL_0_HPHL_COMP_EN, true);
-
-	/* crosstalk coefficients (stock: scale 0x1f, sec2/3 0x11/0x4f) */
-	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 0, 0x1f);
-	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 3, 0x4f);
-	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 2, 0x11);
 }
 
 static void wcd939x_hph_pcm_post_dac(struct snd_soc_component *component)
